ividual effect of each predictor on the dependent variable. Consequently, multicollinearity can obscure the true relationships and lead to unreliable coefficient estimates.\n\nIn summary, coefficients are essential in regression analysis as they quantify the relationships between independent and dependent variables. They are derived from the regression equation and are interpreted as the expected change in the dependent variable for a unit change in the independent variable. Understanding the implications of multicollinearity is vital for accurate coefficient estimation and interpretation, ensuring that the insights drawn from regression models are valid and reliable.", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "annotations": [], "audio": null, "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null}, "content_filter_results": {"hate": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "protected_material_code": {"filtered": false, "detected": false}, "protected_material_text": {"filtered": false, "detected": false}, "self_harm": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "sexual": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "violence": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}}}], "created": 1771165984, "model": "gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18", "object": "chat.completion", "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": "fp_f97eff32c5", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 494, "prompt_tokens": 311, "total_tokens": 805, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "rejected_prediction_tokens": 0}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 0}}, "prompt_filter_results": [{"prompt_index": 0, "content_filter_results": {"hate": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "jailbreak": {"filtered": false, "detected": false}, "self_harm": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "sexual": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "violence": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}}}]}, "input": {"messages": [{"content": "\nYou are an expert economet